3a;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;white-space:nowrap;height:max-content}.chat-body{min-height:350px;padding:24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:17px}.message{max-width:85%;padding:15px 17px;border-radius:14px;line-height:1.6;font-size:14px}.message.ai{background:#eef3f6;border-top-left-radius:3px}.message.user{background:#173c5a;color:#fff;align-self:end;border-top-right-radius:3px}.message b{display:block;margin-bottom:4px;font-size:12px}.chat-compose{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:15px;display:flex;gap:10px}.chat-compose input{width:100%;border:1px solid #bfccd3;border-radius:8px;padding:12px}.chat-compose button{white-space:nowrap}.aside-stack{display:grid;gap:20px}.case-meta{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:10px;font-size:13px;padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.case-meta b{text-align:right}.case-meta:first-of-type{border-top:0}.quote{font:700 22px Georgia,serif;color:#142f49}.queue{display:grid;grid-template-columns:300px minmax(0,1fr);gap:20px}.queue-list{padding:0;overflow:hidden}.queue-item{display:block;width:100%;text-align:left;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;padding:18px;color:#17354e}.queue-item[aria-current="true"]{background:#eaf1f4;box-shadow:inset 4px 0 #b58a45}.queue-item b,.queue-item small{display:block}.queue-item small{margin-top:7px;color:#597084}.timeline{border-left:1px solid #c8d6dd;margin:18px 0 24px 7px;padding-left:21px}.timeline p{position:relative;line-height:1.55;color:#3d596e;font-size:14px}.timeline p:before{content:'';position:absolute;left:-27px;top:6px;width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:#ae8a4e}.inline-flag{display:inline-block;background:#fff3dd;color:#6d4e1e;border-radius:5px;padding:5px 8px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700}.only-mobile{display:none}
    @media(max-width:790px){.hero,.payment-layout,.chat-layout,.queue{grid-template-columns:1fr}.sitebar-note{display:none}.wrap{padding-top:22px}.rule{order:2}.form-area{margin-top:20px}.chat-body{min-height:290px}.queue-list{display:flex;overflow:auto}.queue-item{min-width:190px;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}.only-mobile{display:block}}
    @media(max-width:480px){.topline{font-size:10px}.topline span:last-child{display:none}.sitebar-inner{padding:14px 18px}.brand-name{font-size:19px}.preview{align-items:start}.wrap{padding:18px 14px 50px}.switcher{gap:0;overflow-x:auto;flex-wrap:nowrap}.switcher button{white-space:nowrap;padding:12px 13px;font-size:12px}.hero h1,.screen h1{font-size:33px}.lead{font-size:15px}.rule,.form-area,.panel{padding:20px}.chat-shell{padding:0}.chat-head{padding:16px}.chat-body{padding:16px}.message{max-width:95%}.stage strong{font-size:11px}.chat-compose{flex-wrap:wrap}.chat-compose button{width:100%}}
